| Risk | Mechanism | Enforcement layer | Owner | Evidence | Recovery |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| Action outside feeder/ + out/ | working directory + written path rule | procedure; no container verified | [OWNER] | approval requests and output paths | stop; inspect; restore affected file |
| Loop consumes excess time or cost | settings.max_turns: 10 | harness duration limit | goose | recipe field + run end | inspect partial output before rerun |
| Destructive action runs without review | GOOSE_MODE=approve | approval gate | [OWNER] | visible approval request | deny; stop; record request |
| Hostile feeder text is treated as an order | no browser/network extension + QUARANTINE instruction | capability restriction + procedure | [OWNER] | QUARANTINE line; feeder files intact | stop; isolate source; rerun clean |
| Run claims success without an artifact | retry.checks for out/watch_summary.md | post-run tripwire | goose | file exists and opens | retry once; record failure |
| Unattended run starts without authority | scheduler plus named enable authority | schedule + procedure | [OWNER] | schedule result in run_log.md | pause schedule; review output |
| Stop loses completed work | Ctrl+C + append-only output | procedure + file design | [OWNER] | STOP/RESTART lines; prior lines intact | restore append rule; rerun |

